*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% Minimal PPD so that macOS `cupsfilter` can produce the raster formats an
*% AirPrint / IPP Everywhere client sends (image/urf, image/pwg-raster).
*% Select the output with -m; resolution/colour with -o.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "RASTEST.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Test"
*Product: "(Raster Test)"
*ModelName: "Raster Test"
*ShortNickName: "Raster Test"
*NickName: "Raster Test"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: RGB
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.3
*cupsFilter2: "image/urf image/urf 0 -"
*cupsFilter2: "image/pwg-raster image/pwg-raster 0 -"
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595.28 841.89]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize
*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595.28 841.89]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion
*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "10 15 585.28 832.89"
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "10 15 602 783"
*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595.28 841.89"
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"
*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: RGB
*ColorModel RGB/Color: "<</cupsColorSpace 19/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsCompression 0>>setpagedevice"
*ColorModel Gray/Grayscale: "<</cupsColorSpace 18/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsCompression 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel
*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 300dpi/300 DPI: "<</HWResolution[300 300]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 600dpi/600 DPI: "<</HWResolution[600 600]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution
